{"id":"H7288","lemma":"רַדַּי","transliteration":"radday","sayIt":"rad-DAY","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Raddai","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.2.14;\nson of: Jesse (H3448);\nbrother of: David (H1732), Eliab (H0446I), Abinadab (H0041I), Shimeah (H8093), Nethanel (H5417H), Ozem (H0684), Zeruiah (H6870), Abigail (H0026H)(?) and Elihu (H0453J)\n§ Raddai = \"trampling\"\nthe 5th son of Jesse and brother of David","glosses":["raddai"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"Raddai","kjv":"Raddai"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:14","note":"Nethanel the fourth, Raddai the fifth,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0026","lemma":"אֲבִיגַ֫יִל, אֲבִיגַ֫ל","transliteration":"avigayil","gloss":"Abigail"},{"id":"H0041","lemma":"אֲבִינָדָב","transliteration":"avinadav","gloss":"Abinadab"},{"id":"H0446","lemma":"אֱלִיאָב","transliteration":"eliav","gloss":"Eliab"},{"id":"H0453","lemma":"אֱלִיהוּ","transliteration":"elihu","gloss":"Elihu"},{"id":"H0684","lemma":"אֹ֫צֶם","transliteration":"otsem","gloss":"Ozem"},{"id":"H1732","lemma":"דָּוִד","transliteration":"david","gloss":"David"},{"id":"H3448","lemma":"יִשַׁי","transliteration":"yishay","gloss":"Jesse"},{"id":"H5417","lemma":"נְתַנְאֵל","transliteration":"netanel","gloss":"Nethanel"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}